{"3899610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gatherlands", "steam_appid": 3899610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE → GATHER → CRAFT → GROW STRONGER → RESCUE → PROGRESS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore mysterious islands frozen in time. Gather resources, craft powerful gear, rescue villagers trapped in ice and grow stronger step by step to confront the dark sorcerer Kravenox.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1777915899\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and survival:</strong> Wander mysterious islands, gather resources, discover new areas, and survive in different biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/0ba045af89413434ce8029f822dfd0f9.poster.avif?t=1777915899\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/0ba045af89413434ce8029f822dfd0f9.webm?t=1777915899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/0ba045af89413434ce8029f822dfd0f9.mp4?t=1777915899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1777915899\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting and production:</strong> Dig, chop, craft! Produce tools, weapons, and items with the materials you collect. Strengthen your progress by building structures like furnaces, workbenches, and anvils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1777915899\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming and animal husbandry:</strong> Establish your own farm, sow seeds, and grow your produce. Tame and feed your animals, and collect resources like milk and eggs from them. You manage every stage of production to keep your village alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1777915899\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and dungeons:</strong> Different puzzles and dangerous dungeons await you on every island. Escape traps, fight powerful bosses, and seize legendary loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1777915899\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rescue the villagers:</strong> Every villager you rescue from the ice breathes new life into your village. The blacksmith strengthens your weapons, the cook feeds you, the merchant increases your earnings. Each one offers unique support on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/49c3c2de221c5699c66e45b47a158dbb.poster.avif?t=1777915899\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/49c3c2de221c5699c66e45b47a158dbb.webm?t=1777915899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/49c3c2de221c5699c66e45b47a158dbb.mp4?t=1777915899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1777915899\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pet friends:</strong> Train your pet, explore the world with it. It brings back items you collect and grants passive powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character progression:</strong> Unlock new abilities, expand your inventory, and improve your wizard with passive powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long ago, there was a peaceful village where skilled artisans lived…<br>Until the dark sorcerer Kravenox arrived.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The villagers were imprisoned within ice on distant islands. Time stopped for them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a young mage who awakens years later, freed by the warmth of a magical necklace.<br>Your goal: rebuild your village, rescue the lost artisans, and put an end to the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each island holds a new secret.<br>Each rescued villager brings new hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fate is calling you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to rewrite the legend of Gatherlands?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1777915899\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If you want to chat, leave feedback, or follow the development together, we welcome you to discord. seeing you among us would truly make us happy.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE → GATHER → CRAFT → GROW STRONGER → RESCUE → PROGRESS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore mysterious islands frozen in time. Gather resources, craft powerful gear, rescue villagers trapped in ice and grow stronger step by step to confront the dark sorcerer Kravenox.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1777915899\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and survival:</strong> Wander mysterious islands, gather resources, discover new areas, and survive in different biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/0ba045af89413434ce8029f822dfd0f9.poster.avif?t=1777915899\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/0ba045af89413434ce8029f822dfd0f9.webm?t=1777915899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/0ba045af89413434ce8029f822dfd0f9.mp4?t=1777915899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1777915899\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting and production:</strong> Dig, chop, craft! Produce tools, weapons, and items with the materials you collect. Strengthen your progress by building structures like furnaces, workbenches, and anvils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1777915899\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming and animal husbandry:</strong> Establish your own farm, sow seeds, and grow your produce. Tame and feed your animals, and collect resources like milk and eggs from them. You manage every stage of production to keep your village alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1777915899\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles and dungeons:</strong> Different puzzles and dangerous dungeons await you on every island. Escape traps, fight powerful bosses, and seize legendary loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/55c43b610c3127f9d8bcdff6501572a6.webp?t=1777915899\" width=1080 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rescue the villagers:</strong> Every villager you rescue from the ice breathes new life into your village. The blacksmith strengthens your weapons, the cook feeds you, the merchant increases your earnings. Each one offers unique support on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899610/extras/49c3c2de221c5699c66e45b47a158dbb.poster.avif?t=1777915899\" width=1080 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/